WEBVTT

00:03:28.079 --> 00:03:30.539
with the reason she’d been
admitted to the hospital.

00:03:30.539 --> 00:03:32.124
They might just overlook it.

00:03:32.124 --> 00:03:33.626
Or if they did notice it,

00:03:33.626 --> 00:03:36.087
they might assume
this was just her regular posture.

00:03:36.128 --> 00:03:37.255
And it really wasn’t.

00:03:38.089 --> 00:03:39.298
I didn’t know what to do.

00:03:40.758 --> 00:03:42.593
And that’s when it came to me:

00:03:42.593 --> 00:03:43.803
a picture could help.

00:03:44.595 --> 00:03:45.638
So I drew one.

00:03:47.014 --> 00:03:48.683
I wrote “Help for Jocelyn.”

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:50.351
“She leans to the left.

00:03:50.726 --> 00:03:53.104
Please support wheelchair
and bed with pillows.”

00:03:53.646 --> 00:03:56.565
I drew a circle around the leg
that kept getting injured,

00:03:56.565 --> 00:03:58.651
and I drew my mom lying in bed,

00:03:58.651 --> 00:04:01.779
and I wrote, “This is a comfy 
sleeping position!”